e href="#eva-icons-chevron-right"></use></svg></a></li><li class="SideNavigationItem bKGabX"><a class="Link hxlSIK gMcxnl" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/debt" target="_self"><span>Debt</span><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-chevron-right"></use></svg></a></li><li class="SideNavigationItem bKGabX"><a class="Link hxlSIK gMcxnl" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/nzx-foreign-exempt" target="_self"><span>Foreign Exempt Issuers</span><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-chevron-right"></use></svg></a></li><li class="SideNavigationItem bKGabX"><a class="Link hxlSIK gMcxnl" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/case-studies" target="_self"><span>Case studies</span><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-chevron-right"></use></svg></a></li><li class="SideNavigationItem bKGabX"><a class="Link hxlSIK gMcxnl" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/nzx-issuer-update" target="_self"><span>NZX Issuer Update</span><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-chevron-right"></use></svg></a></li><li class="SideNavigationItem bKGabX"><a class="Link hxlSIK gMcxnl" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/listing-fees" target="_self"><span>Listing Fees</span><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-chevron-right"></use></svg></a></li><li class="SideNavigationItem bKGabX"><a class="Link hxlSIK gMcxnl" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/contacts" target="_self"><span>Contacts</span><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-chevron-right"></use></svg></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="Stack jBpqRq" style="overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden"><h1>Listing on NZX</h1><iframe class="EmbedVideo gbdCqr" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/iY22q_GhCRw" title="Listing on NZX" frameBorder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen=""></iframe><p>NZX provides a world class exchange platform to access capital and engage investors, employees and the general public in your business’s growth story. </p><div class="Stack jBpqRq TilesPanel PJLV" style="overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="1aJhuFo3UrxNekFcFRQotL"><div class="Grid jfsytL grid-lg-3 grid-sm-1" style="grid-gap:0px"><div class="Tile khvBhe" breakpoint="large" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="39h47h5JXMeGX8WitfF0qx"><div class="TileName hNVhpR">$1841m</div><div class="TileTitle cPSNYm"><p>Total equity listed and raised YTD 2026<sup>1,3</sup></p></div></div><div class="Tile khvBhe" breakpoint="large" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="6C6julCD2TBRCqFcozXE8O"><div class="TileName hNVhpR">$2808m</div><div class="TileTitle cPSNYm"><p>Total debt raised YTD 2026<sup>1</sup></p></div></div><div class="Tile khvBhe" breakpoint="large" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="3s1OjWzQwLebMX3sIyjIf9"><div class="TileName hNVhpR">$1385m</div><div class="TileTitle cPSNYm"><p>Total funds raised YTD 2026<sup>1</sup></p></div></div></div><div class="Grid jfsytL grid-lg-3 grid-sm-1" style="grid-gap:0px"><div class="Tile khvBhe" breakpoint="large" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="43yWrXT37G4VFe9FHBeied"><div class="TileName hNVhpR">67.7%</div><div class="TileTitle cPSNYm"><p>Total value traded on Market<sup>1</sup></p></div></div><div class="Tile khvBhe" breakpoint="large" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="6uMhXt5Cg7jw6bs2WOa5hX"><div class="TileName hNVhpR">54.1%</div><div class="TileTitle cPSNYm"><p>Total market capitalization as a % of GDP<sup>1</sup></p></div></div><div class="Tile khvBhe" breakpoint="large" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="7ainj4Bv0ixzz44BbiXXSY"><div class="TileName hNVhpR">$21,197m</div><div class="TileTitle cPSNYm"><p>Total value traded YTD 2026<sup>1</sup></p></div></div></div><div class="Grid jfsytL grid-lg-3 grid-sm-1" style="grid-gap:0px"><div class="Tile khvBhe" breakpoint="large" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="YT2A8Pe10ienLFo2mTJpb"><div class="TileName hNVhpR">$6025m</div><div class="TileTitle cPSNYm"><p>Total listed green bonds<sup>1</sup></p></div></div><div class="Tile khvBhe" breakpoint="large" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="1Uv0qvcoQQyC66iX9v2UKf"><div class="TileName hNVhpR">197</div><div class="TileTitle cPSNYm"><p>Total unique issuers on NZX Boards<sup>1</sup></p></div></div></div></div><p>The New Zealand Main Board for equities and funds (NZSX) and New Zealand Debt Market (NZDX) are home to a variety of businesses. They include debt and equity issuers, cooperatives and managed funds. They reflect the unique nature of New Zealand’s economic environment. NZX is always happy to discuss how to meet the unique needs of your business in a listed environment. </p><div class="Panel khDsNn iNyLgJ" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="4BdXpbGbBltp4NMgA4Yd3L" breakpoint="large" id="4BdXpbGbBltp4NMgA4Yd3L"><div class="PanelContent PJLV gLqFld"><p><b>You can learn more about listing equity </b><a class="Link hxlSIK gMcxnl" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/equity" style="font-weight:bold" target="_self">here</a><b> and funds </b><a class="Link hxlSIK gMcxnl" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/funds" style="font-weight:bold" target="_self">here</a><b>. </b></p><p><b>For more information about debt listings on the NZDX, visit us </b><a class="Link hxlSIK gMcxnl" href="/services/listing-on-nzx-markets/debt" style="font-weight:bold" target="_self">here</a>.</p></div></div><div class="ContactInformationPanel GgmVh"><h4 class="ContactInformationPanelHeader gbPVzD">Capital Markets Origination Team</h4><div class="Grid jfsytL grid-lg-2 grid-sm-1" style="grid-gap:30px"><div class="ContactInformationBlock ekbUTp" title="GM – Listings, Information Services and Environmental Markets " data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="5MvTFVGASjGnroeSQyGOKs"><div class="ContactInformationRow likUKR dOjfTr">Jeremy Anderson</div><div class="ContactInformationRow likUKR">GM – Listings, Information Services and Environmental Markets</div><div class="ContactInformationRow likUKR"><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-phone"></use></svg>+ 64 21 819 715</div><div class="ContactInformationRow likUKR"><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-email"></use></svg><a href="mailto:jeremy.anderson@nzx.com">jeremy.anderson@nzx.com</a></div></div><div class="ContactInformationBlock ekbUTp" title="Relationship Manager - Georgia Thompson" data-contentful-field-id="content" data-contentful-entry-id="1dSUgvSxB3ULv5NhiYh0s4"><div class="ContactInformationRow likUKR dOjfTr">Georgia Thompson</div><div class="ContactInformationRow likUKR">Relationship Manager</div><div class="ContactInformationRow likUKR"><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-phone"></use></svg>+64 27 391 8483</div><div class="ContactInformationRow likUKR"><svg class="Icon bQczPV" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24"><use href="#eva-icons-email"></use></svg><a href="mailto:georgia.thompson@nzx.com">georgia.thompson@nzx.com</a></div></div><div class="ContactInformationBlock ekbUTp" titl